  "story": {
    "day": 119,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Weekend",
    "sentences": [
      "Yesterday, Kaya volunteered to clean her room.",
      "She didn't feel sick; the day before yesterday she did babysit.",
      "Her plan was to move a plant and water it carefully.",
      "First, she went to the bathroom and brushed her tooth.",
      "Later, she checked a message on her smartphone.",
      "It was for an international meeting in the corner.",
      "Everybody discussed culture from another country and travel.",
      "An interviewer answered, \"Yeah, I finished my post office trip ago.\"",
      "However, a noisy sound of laughter made her feel lonely.",
      "She sit away from them and drank barley tea. She didn't drop it.",
      "\"Which way did the witch skate in that circus setting? A battle!\"",
      "Kaya didn't stop back. Sure, the roast was late else on twenty-second."
    ]
  }
}